SUMMARY:Cookie Cutter Ornaments
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\n**Cookie Cutter Ornaments*
 *\n***💰 Cost: $45(all materials)***\n\n📅 **Dates:** Nov. 28\, 2026\n
 📍 **Location:** Full Circle Studio\, 360 Tesconi Circle Ste C\, Santa R
 osa\, CA\n👥 **Ages:** 16+\n\nJoin us for a hands-on clay workshop at **
 Full Circle Studio 360!** In this Holiday Event\, you'll make Ornaments fr
 om Cookie Cutters\, Use Ours or Bring Your Own\,\n\nHave you ever spent ti
 me on making beautiful cookies and thought wouldn't these be great for orn
 aments. Now you can make permanent ornaments and even have them as keepsak
 es.\n\nMake and Decorate 5-10 clay cookie cutter ornaments and decorate th
 em. They will be ready for pick up after Dec. 11th.\n\nThis is a great opp
 ortunity to explore your creativity\, meet fellow art lovers\, and take ho
 me a unique handmade piece! No prior experience needed.\n\n🎟️ **Limit
 ed spots available – reserve your space today!**
