SUMMARY:Paint Your Pet -great gift too!
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\n*\\*\\*PLEASE GO TO TARA'S
  WEBSITE TO REGISTER\\*\\**\n*https://www.taradickinson.com/classes/art-cl
 asses*\n*Thank you 😊*\n______________________________________\nWe start
  by tracing an image of your pet on canvas or paper. Use of watercolor or 
 acrylic paint is available.\n\nYou're then guided in an expressive art sty
 le of painting\; we're not going for realism\, more character & whimsy.\n\
 n* This is an excellent way to create a memory that will l ast a lifetime!
 \n* Perfect for all kinds of pet owners: cats\, dogs\, birds\, horses...\n
 * As long as you have a photo you like\, we can paint your pet!\n\nAll art
  supplies & full instructions provided.\n*❤️This makes a unique & hear
 tfelt gift for the pet lover on your list!*
