SUMMARY:Paint Your Partner (friend\, relative)
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\n*\\*\\*Please register on 
 Tara's website.\\*\\**\n*Thank you .*\n*___________*___________________\n*
 *PAINT YOUR PARTNER - 2 dates offered!**\n*Holiday Gifts\, Private Parties
 \, Work Groups\, Girls' Night\, Bachelorette... reach out to Tara if you'd
  like a private party.*\n\n**Enjoy** some artsy fun as you & your friends 
 unleash your artistic side and find out how they see you! Paint each other
  for a day of fun & memory-making.\n\n* The results are usually hilarious!
  Potentially terrible art skills are welcome.\n* Absolute beginners who've
  never picked up a paintbrush will have a blast too!\n* An excellent way t
 o create memories that will last a lifetime (with the painted proof to han
 g on the wall!).\n\nAll art supplies & instruction included.\n\n* Friday\,
  Dec. 4th\, 1-2:30 PM\n* Thursday\, Dec. 10th\, 5:30 -7 PM\n\nFEE: $35
