SUMMARY:Beginners Watercolor- holiday cards!
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\n*\\*\\*Please register on 
 Tara's website \\*\\**\n*https://www.taradickinson.com/classes/art-classes
 *\n*Thank you!*\n_________________________________\n\n**Watercolor Holiday
  Notecards**\n100% beginner-friendly. The goal is to let loose\, enjoy the
  process of painting & expressing yourself.\n\n* SUBJECT: Ornaments & Tree
 s!\n* Make 1/2 dozen of your choice!\n\nWhat you'll learn:\n\n* Color blen
 ding and artistic composition.\n* Brushstroke practice\, layering\, and ad
 ding fine details to finish off our masterpieces\n* Most importantly\, pra
 ctice letting go! Learning how to play\, explore\, and have fun making art
 !\n\nFEE: $45\nFull Circle Studio\, 360 Tesconi Circle\, Santa Rosa
