SUMMARY:Painting With Beads: Moon Dreams
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\nCreate a little moonlight 
 magic in this relaxing\, beginner-friendly workshop!\nJoin artist Julia Bo
 mbardier for a creative morning exploring paint\, shimmering metallic foil
 s\, and colorful glass beads as you create your own Moon Dreams artwork on
  an 8 × 8 canvas.\nYou'll learn the Painting With Beads technique while a
 dding your own personal touches to this whimsical\, dimensional piece.\n**
 No experience necessary!** All materials are provided\, and you'll leave w
 ith a finished piece of art to take home.\n\n**Cost: $75 per person**\nSpa
 ce is limited\, and advance registration is required.\n**Reserve your seat
 :** Visit [Magic Door's class page](https://magicdoorinc.com/classes/) and
  click "Reserve Your Seat" to purchase your ticket securely through Square
 .
