SUMMARY:Soul Tapestry 
DESCRIPTION:Full Circle Studio - Creative Arts\nWeaving Intention through 
 Art and Song\n\n\\*\\*Your longing has a voice. What if it also had a song
  and a picture?\\*\\*\n\nJoin **Christi Corradi and Astra Fox for SOUL TAP
 ESTRY!**\n\nWe'll weave personal longings into a group mantra\, music\, an
 d art!\n\nCreate your own neurographic artwork\, take it home\, and receiv
 e a digital recording of the group mantra.\n\nNo experience needed!\n\nPle
 ase sign up at [HERE](https://maol.as.me/schedule/44aa5d08/?appointmentTyp
 eIds%5B%5D=100478286)
